{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 14, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest a journey to Japan's shore\nA land of ancient temples and cherry blossoms galore\nI shall craft an itinerary for thee to follow with care\nAnd make thy travels in this fair land a wondrous affair\n\nDay one thou shalt arrive in Tokyo's bustling streets\nA city of neon lights and modern delights to greet\nThou shalt check into thy lodgings and take a stroll about\nTo marvel at the towering skyscrapers and busy streets devout\n\nDay two thou shalt visit the famous Tsukiji Fish Market's hallowed halls\nWhere fresh sushi and seafood shall tempt thy senses' calls\nThen on to the Meiji Shrine a serene oasis in the midst\nOf Tokyo's chaos where thou shalt find peace and quiet to persist\n\nDay three thou shalt journey to the famous Sensoji Temple's grandeur\nA Buddhist shrine of ancient lore and mystic power to ensnare\nThou shalt wander through the stalls of Nakamise shopping street\nWhere ancient trinkets and souvenirs shall tempt thy heart to beat\n\nDay four thou shalt visit the Tokyo Skytree's lofty height\nWhere panoramic views of the city shall take thy breath in flight\nThen on to the Asakusa district where ancient history doth reside\nAnd thou shalt walk in the footsteps of Japan's ancient pride\n\nDay five thou shalt depart for Kyoto's hallowed grounds\nA city of ancient temples and gardens renowned\nThou shalt visit the Fushimi Inari Shrine's famous orange gates\nAnd walk the sacred path of a thousand torii in reverent states\n\nDay six thou shalt visit the Kinkaku-ji Temple's golden glow\nA Zen Buddhist shrine of serenity and peacefulness to bestow\nThou shalt stroll through the gardens of the Arashiyama bamboo grove\nWhere nature's beauty shall captivate thy heart and senses to improve\n\nDay seven thou shalt visit the Nijo Castle's secret nightingales\nA UNESCO World Heritage site of ancient Japanese tales\nThou shalt walk in the footsteps of samurai and nobles of old\nAnd experience the history and culture of Japan to unfold\n\nDay eight thou shalt depart for Hiroshima's solemn shore\nA city of peace and remembrance where thou shalt visit the Atomic Bomb Dome's sorrow\nThou shalt pay respects to the victims of war's devastation and pain\nAnd reflect on the importance of peace and love to sustain\n\nDay nine thou shalt visit the Miyajima Island's sacred deer\nA place of ancient Shinto lore and mystic power to appear\nThou shalt watch the sunset over the Itsukushima Shrine's grandeur\nAnd experience the beauty and magic of Japan's sacred hour\n\nDay ten thou shalt depart for Osaka's vibrant streets\nA city of food and entertainment where thou shalt eat and drink to feast\nThou shalt visit the Osaka Castle's mighty walls and moat\nAnd experience the excitement and energy of this fair city to float\n\nThus endeth our journey through Japan's wondrous land\nA land of ancient temples and modern delights to withstand\nMay thy travels be filled with wonder and awe\nAnd may the spirit of Japan's culture and history forever draw.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.85221833}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.5111953}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.19632839}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.062069237}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.10045276}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -1.0498961}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.11570101}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.0850482}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.017843556}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0010958863}, {"token": " ancient", "logprob": -2.0464716}, {"token": " temples", "logprob": -1.9592198}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.3104855}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -3.3486617}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob":